@startuml
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor Student as "Student"
participant "BookingService" as Service
participant "BookingRepository" as Repo

Student -> Service: requestBooking(roomId, timeSlot)
activate Service

Service -> Service: validateRules(timeSlot)
note right: **R1 Validation:**\n- Future start time\n- Duration > 0 and <= 2 hours

Service -> Repo: checkRoomAvailability(roomId, timeSlot)
activate Repo
note right: **R2 & R3 Checks:**\n- Checks if room is blocked (R3)\n- Checks for overlapping active bookings (R2)
Repo --> Service: availabilityStatus (isFree, isNotBlocked)
deactivate Repo

alt Room is free, not blocked, and rules pass (R1, R2, R3 valid)
    Service -> Repo: saveBooking(booking)
    activate Repo
    Repo --> Service: bookingSaved
    deactivate Repo

    Service --> Student: bookingConfirmation
    note left: **R4:** Successful booking\nproduces a confirmation
else Validation fails, room is blocked (R3), or time slot overlaps (R2)
    Service --> Student: bookingRejected (Error Reason)
end

deactivate Service
@enduml